  "scope": "GPU keep-warm: the RTX 5090 container moves to runtime 32c21f73, whose ninfer-serve --gpu-keep-warm-ms N keeps the GPU out of its low-power idle states for N ms after the server goes idle, and its profile advances to qwen38-5090-v0.8.2 with --gpu-keep-warm-ms 60000 (configuration 56878aed). New sessions after 12-58 s of idle prefilled in 0.155-0.157 s instead of 0.253-0.304 s with byte-identical outputs, at about 71 W while held (docs/measurements/2026-09-26-engine-keep-warm.json). The RTX 4090 native package 5a774841, the upstream OMP 18.3.0 client, the model and the memory floors are unchanged from v0.8.1. RTX 3090 is omitted pending physical-host access. Every RTX 5090 gate below was measured on the published image; the RTX 4090 gates are v0.8.1's for the same package.",
